<Base title="Console Preview | Kubernautic" description="Learn about the planned read-only Kubernautic Console Preview for registered visitors."><section class="shell page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DISCOVERY / COMING SOON</span><h1>See Kubernetes<br/><span class="gradient-text">through a new lens.</span></h1><p>We are preparing a registered, read-only preview of the Kubernautic Console. Explore the interface and sample operational insights—without changing cluster resources.</p><div class="button-group"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Ask about Early Access ↗</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/platform/">Explore the Platform ↗</a></div></section><section class="shell section single-section"><div class="note-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHAT THE PREVIEW WILL INCLUDE</span><h2>Shared demo environment. Restricted access.</h2><p>Registered users will be assigned a scoped, read-only view of demo workloads. Sensitive data and privileged actions will not be exposed. Registration and authentication are not yet live.</p></div><span class="mock-pill">COMING SOON</span></div><div class="info-line"><strong>Access</strong>Registration and identity verification when launched</div><div class="info-line"><strong>Environment</strong>Shared Kubernetes demo cluster</div><div class="info-line"><strong>Permissions</strong>Strict read-only, namespace-scoped permissions</div><div class="info-line"><strong>Production</strong>Dedicated enterprise deployments on request</div></section></Base>
